(Spindle Warmup)
(Run this program prior to machining each time)
(Run without any load.)
(This ensures that the bearings reach their running temperature)
(gradually and that the bearing races expand evenly.)

(5min at 50%)
S12000 M03
G04 P300

(3min at 75%)
S18000 M03
G04 P180

(3min at 100%)
S23500 M03
G04 P180

M05
M30
